% Vehicles that are controlled externally
%
% iveh (=0 for first veh, imax for last)
% type of control indicated by proj extension (<n> is line, not veh index!)
%
% (1) Externally controlled velocity: project extension .vlead<n>
%     (.vleadBosch obsolete; Bosch format also works with .vlead<n> )
% (2) Externally controlled alpha_v0: project extension .alpha_v0<n>
% (3) Externally controlled acceleration: project extension .brake<n>
%     acceleration fixed => lies in responsability of controller 
%     to avoid crashes!!!
%
% controlled vehicle index
%-----------------------------------------
1
